<title>UK: Taylor Woodrow awarded 20 mln stg contract.</title>
<headline>Taylor Woodrow awarded 20 mln stg contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taylor Woodrow Plc, the UK construction to building group, has been awarded a 20 million stg contract to supply concrete tunnel linings to the Copenhagen Metro.</p>
<p>The group said it was the largest contract of its kind and will supply 15 kilometres of reinforced lining for a tunnel with a diameter of 4.9 metres.</p>
<p>The first delivery will be made in June 1997 and will extend for two and a half years.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
